<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Shapath Hacker</title>

<style>
*{
margin:0;
padding:0;
box-sizing:border-box;
font-family:Arial,sans-serif;
}

body{
background:#0d0d0d;
color:white;
}

header{
background:#111;
padding:20px;
display:flex;
justify-content:space-between;
align-items:center;
position:sticky;
top:0;
}

.logo{
font-size:30px;
font-weight:bold;
color:#ff0000;
}

nav a{
color:white;
text-decoration:none;
margin-left:20px;
}

.hero{
height:90vh;
display:flex;
flex-direction:column;
justify-content:center;
align-items:center;
text-align:center;
background:linear-gradient(rgba(0,0,0,.7),rgba(0,0,0,.7)),
url("https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1518770660439-4636190af475?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1600&q=80");
background-size:cover;
background-position:center;
}

.hero h1{
font-size:60px;
color:#ff0000;
}

.hero p{
font-size:22px;
margin:20px;
}

.btn{
display:inline-block;
padding:15px 35px;
background:#ff0000;
color:white;
text-decoration:none;
border-radius:30px;
font-weight:bold;
}

section{
padding:60px 20px;
max-width:1100px;
margin:auto;
}

.cards{
display:grid;
grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(250px,1fr));
gap:20px;
}

.card{
background:#1b1b1b;
padding:20px;
border-radius:12px;
text-align:center;
}

.card h3{
color:#ff3b3b;
margin-bottom:10px;
}

footer{
background:#111;
text-align:center;
padding:25px;
margin-top:40px;
}
</style>
</head>

<body>

<header>
<div class="logo">SHAPATH HACKER</div>

<nav>
<a href="#">Home</a>
<a href="#videos">Videos</a>
<a href="#about">About</a>
<a href="#contact">Contact</a>
</nav>
</header>

<section class="hero">
<h1>SHAPATH HACKER</h1>
<p>Animation Stories • Creative Adventures • New Videos Every Week</p>

<a class="btn" href="https://youtube.com/@shapathhacker89928?si=EBUPKl-Rdixo_oM7" target="_blank">
Watch on YouTube
</a>
</section>

<section id="videos">
<h2 style="color:#ff0000;text-align:center;">Featured Videos</h2>

<div class="cards">

<div class="card">
<h3>Animation Story</h3>
<p>Exciting and emotional animation adventures.</p>
</div>

<div class="card">
<h3>New Uploads</h3>
<p>Fresh animated stories every week.</p>
</div>

<div class="card">
<h3>Subscribe</h3>
<p>Join the Shapath Hacker family today!</p>
</div>

</div>
</section>

<section id="about">
<h2 style="color:#ff0000;">About</h2>
<br>
<p>
Welcome to <b>Shapath Hacker</b>. This channel creates amazing
animation stories filled with adventure, fun, emotions, and creativity.
Subscribe to enjoy new animated videos every week.
</p>
</section>

<section id="contact">
<h2 style="color:#ff0000;">Contact</h2>
<br>

<p>YouTube:
<a style="color:#ff0000;"
href="https://youtube.com/@shapathhacker89928?si=EBUPKl-Rdixo_oM7">
Shapath Hacker
</a>
</p>

</section>

<footer>
© 2026 SHAPATH HACKER | All Rights Reserved
</footer>

</body>
</html>
